r, Vesryn?\nhttps://imgur.com/a/G9mBwPQ\n\nCan you please draw her in this outfit: https://www.pinterest.com/pin/17732992273432073/\nhttps://www.pinterest.com/pin/6192518227191987/\n\nShe's very feminine and delicate, her skin is very dewy. Do as you please!\nThank you!", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hoshi_25f/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1194631, "client_id": 1438708, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/63a4a731/uploads/origins/0ca02ccb-46d5-4c6a-99d8-bef3892541d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d8092d0bd62a3ef2895a881bc4b09837", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/63a4a731/uploads/origins/0ca02ccb-46d5-4c6a-99d8-bef3892541d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d8092d0bd62a3ef2895a881bc4b09837, https://si.imgix.net/63a4a731/uploads/origins/0ca02ccb-46d5-4c6a-99d8-bef3892541d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4ac7370129ed9d828c4d83b85482f92 2x, https://si.imgix.net/63a4a731/uploads/origins/0ca02ccb-46d5-4c6a-99d8-bef3892541d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74637e40a462927799731f022ac7449d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/63a4a731/uploads/origins/0ca02ccb-46d5-4c6a-99d8-bef3892541d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6b81ad3b19056ee61b5096dbb0ac58d4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/63a4a731/uploads/origins/0ca02ccb-46d5-4c6a-99d8-bef3892541d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6b81ad3b19056ee61b5096dbb0ac58d4, https://si.imgix.net/63a4a731/uploads/origins/0ca02ccb-46d5-4c6a-99d8-bef3892541d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr